WEBVTT

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.470
So this is where you were hiding.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:23.010
Onii-chan!

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:26.440
I've been looking for you.

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:27.330
Good grief.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:29.460
I was scared.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.980
I thought I'd never see you again, Onii-chan.

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:36.460
No more tears now.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.260
I'll always...

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:52.670
That was...

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:03.610
That was a confession, wasn't it?

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.480
Stupid Onii-chan.

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:18.830
<i>I'm the stupid one.</i>

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:25.480
<i>I've caused nothing but trouble for Onii-chan 
because I couldn't be honest with him.</i>

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:28.600
<i>Because I couldn't tell him how I felt.</i>

00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:31.430
<i>Because I kept putting off saying it.</i>

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:34.970
<i>And after all that, I'm left with this...</i>

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:42.450
<i>I'm really stupid and weak.</i>

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:43.990
<b>My Sister, 
My Writer

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:51.630
Episode 10: It's Okay for Me to Be Moe for Little Sisters

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:49.090
Dammit, she's not answering!

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:57.010
<i>It's no good. I can't find her anywhere.</i>

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:00.330
Onii-chan, you already
 find little sisters moe.

00:02:01.910 --> 00:02:02.730
Dammit.

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:05.430
I actually knew all along!

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:09.870
I knew how much I loved 
the little sister archetype.

00:02:09.870 --> 00:02:15.320
But I could never admit it because 
I didn't want her to hate me.

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:16.620
But in the end...

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:20.470
I wound up hurting her anyway.

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.400
Seriously, what <i>is</i> it with me? 
I'm a terrible excuse for a brother!

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.870
So this is where you were hiding.

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:38.210
That's right.

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:41.070
That day, I was looking 
for her just like this, too.

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:51.020
Suzuka...

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:53.430
I've been looking for you.

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:57.830
Wh-What are you doing here?

00:02:57.830 --> 00:03:00.750
Sakura-san just asked you out, 
didn't she, Onii-chan?

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:04.830
So why have you even come after me?

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:07.950
No, you misunderstood the situation.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:09.140
"Misunderstood"?

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:13.050
What was there to misunderstand?

00:03:13.050 --> 00:03:14.460
I'm telling the truth.

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:17.310
She did that for the contest.

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:19.640
Her confession was all an act.

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.720
Y-You're lying!

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:24.920
There's no way that was an act.

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:27.010
She told me so herself!

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:28.730
You're lying. You're lying!

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:31.100
You're a dirty liar!

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:36.650
This is important, so you 
shouldn't lie to your little sister.

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:40.860
<i>Yeah, I know.</i>

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:43.410
<i>All of this happened because I was lying.</i>

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:46.870
<i>So I have to do something about it!</i>

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:48.580
Suzuka, listen to me!

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.490
Everything I'm about 
to tell you is the truth!

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:53.940
I swear on my life it's the truth.

00:03:54.390 --> 00:03:55.740
So believe me when I say this!

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:57.980
O-Onii-chan, what are...

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:00.180
I've...

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:04.050
I've always found little 
sisters totally moe!

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:06.300
Huh?

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:09.050
I love little sister moe with 
every fiber of my being!

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:12.630
The whole reason I got 
hooked on light novels

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:14.440
was because of a little sister romcom!

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:17.710
Y-You're lying!

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:21.190
O-Onii-chan, you can't... y-you can't like...

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:22.300
I'm not lying!

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:25.090
Everything I'm telling you is true!

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:25.880
You listening?

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.950
The little sister archetype 
is the absolute best.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:31.200
They're destined to be protected.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:34.140
It's the joy of someone relying 
on you and being spoiled by you!

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.670
And it's a cute girl younger than you!

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:36.710
And above all!

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:39.210
That special moniker: "Onii-chan"!

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:40.960
O-Onii...

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:43.840
All of it drives me wild.

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:45.570
There's nothing about it that <i>isn't</i> moe!

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:49.720
It's the ultimate moe archetype 
that shines above all the rest!

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:51.720
That's what little sisters are!

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:53.560
Wh-What are you shouting?

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:57.290
B-Besides, what's gotten 
into you, all of a sudden?

00:04:57.290 --> 00:05:01.420
Up to now, you've always strongly 
denied liking the little sister archetype.

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:02.740
But now...

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:05.800
That's because I've been hiding 
my love for it this whole time.

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:08.420
I tried to convince myself that
I didn't find little sisters moe.

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:10.170
Why?

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:14.000
Because I didn't want you 
to hate me even more.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:15.000
Huh?

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:19.330
If you'd found out I love the little sister 
archetype when I have one for real...

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:21.940
I figured you'd hate me even more

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:24.510
if you discovered how creepy I am.

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:29.510
But I've caused you no end of problems
because I hid this from you...

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:32.360
So I've steeled myself for your reaction.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:34.190
I don't care if you hate me.

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:37.270
I just don't want to hurt you ever again!

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:39.270
O-Onii-chan...

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:42.200
So just leave Sakurada-san to me.

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:46.280
I'm not going to let him rework 
the ultimate little sister.

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:53.040
I-I would never hate you because 
of something like that, Onii-chan.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.790
But why?

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:56.400
Why did you do that?

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:58.920
I thought it was all just me.

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:01.290
What were you trying to achieve, Onii-chan?

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:02.780
S-Suzuka?

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:05.250
I'm mad as hell at you!

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:08.310
Why didn't you just tell me sooner?

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:09.480
If you had...

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:11.050
If you had, then I would've...

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:15.760
Well, you have to understand, 
I only just realized myself...

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:19.450
But the person I absolutely 
can't forgive is myself.

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:22.060
It's my fault everything 
ended up like this...

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:24.230
And yet... and yet...

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:28.870
Why am I so happy it turned out this way?

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:34.500
Do you know how happy I feel just knowing 
you feel the way you do, Onii-chan?

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:37.580
Suzuka...

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:43.210
Come on, everyone's waiting for us.

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:46.230
Oh, y-yes. You're right.

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:49.030
Um, Onii-chan?

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:53.580
Well, about the contest...

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:55.400
Who won in the end?

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:57.970
The contest?

00:06:57.970 --> 00:07:00.160
Oh, right.

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:03.980
I guess you did.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:07.820
I-I see.

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:11.000
Well, I can't say I'm happy I won, but...

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:15.120
I mean, it's only natural that
the <i>real</i> little sister won.

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:16.890
Right.

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:25.290
It's just like that day, long ago.

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:28.300
Yeah.

00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:31.360
I found you here then, too.

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:32.890
Yeah.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:39.890
Do you remember the promise 
we made back then?

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:54.280
Promise?

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:58.370
No, it's fine if you don't remember.

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:02.740
Now, let's go find everyone, shall we?

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:05.170
We've kept them waiting
 long enough already.

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:07.830
Yeah, we have.

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:17.180
Tomorrow, I finally have another 
meeting with Sakurada-san...

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:23.100
I can't sleep.

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:33.150
Sakura? What are you doing up so late?

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:37.850
I tried to sleep, but couldn't.

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:51.590
The theme park we went 
to today was really fun.

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:55.560
Yeah. Even though we hit 
some bumps in the road.

00:08:56.430 --> 00:09:02.600
I was imitating Yuuka-chan 
from your book. Did you realize?

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:07.100
Yeah. I had a sneaking 
suspicion that was the case.

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:10.100
But, ultimately, I was only imitating.

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:13.840
I couldn't measure up to the real thing.

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:15.990
Sakura.

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:20.150
Oh, but I haven't given up yet, either.

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:22.510
My dream of becoming your little sister

00:09:22.510 --> 00:09:24.560
has only grown stronger.

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:27.000
Speaking of which...

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:32.660
You're taking on that guy who said you don't 
get little sister moe tomorrow, aren't you?

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:36.190
What kind of person would even say 
something like that to you of all people?

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:44.060
Well, it's the man who's gonna direct 
the anime adaptation, Sakurada Itsuki.

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:46.310
Huh? Sakurada Itsuki?

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.010
What's the matter?

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:49.810
Oh, no...

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:52.400
I'm heading to bed now.

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:54.750
Thank you for the cocoa.

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:56.460
Sure...

00:09:57.990 --> 00:09:59.100
Good night...

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:04.370
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:05.330
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:05.450
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:05.580
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:06.540
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:06.660
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:06.790
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:06.910
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:07.040
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:12.420
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:10.760
"Thanks for taking care 
of me these past few days."

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:12.420
"I promise to repay your kindness one day."

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:18.430
<b>To Towano Chikai-sensei</b>

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:18.430
<b>Thanks for taking care of me these past few days.</b>

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:18.430
<b>I promise to repay your kindness one day.</b>

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:18.430
<b>There's something I have to do now,</b>

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:18.430
<b>so I'm going back home.</b>

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:18.430
<b>I'm sorry I didn't get chance to say goodbye properly.</b>

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:18.430
<b>Minazuki Sakura</b>

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:16.260
"There's something I have to do now, 
so I'm going back home."

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:18.430
"I'm sorry I didn't get chance
to say goodbye properly."

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:21.050
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.010
"Minazuki Sakura."

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:21.180
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:21.300
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:21.430
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:21.720
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:22.010
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:23.430
To Towano Chikai-sensei

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:23.430
Onii-chan?

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:24.990
What's wrong?

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:30.950
Wh-What do you think happened?

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:31.940
I don't know.

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:34.420
Something must've come up.

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:43.530
The time has come, huh?

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:44.860
Don't worry.

00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:48.420
I'll convince Sakurada-san 
not to make any changes.

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:51.540
I-It's not like I'm all that worried.

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:56.530
A-After all, you've now realized
 that you love little sisters.

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:59.680
Which means, there's the 
<i>potential</i> you, and well...

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:03.430
It's about time.

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:04.470
Let's go in.

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:08.930
<b>My Sister, 
My Writer

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:20.570
Towano-sensei, you brought your 
little sister with you again today?

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:25.810
So why did you call me here today?

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:28.710
I'm here because Senpai insisted that I come,

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:31.330
but there's nothing left for me to say.

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:35.090
You might have nothing more to say, but I do.

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:35.950
What?

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:37.590
Sensei.

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:40.310
Given how the director already feels,

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:43.140
I don't think there's much
 room for further debate.

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:47.210
Maybe not, but I cannot allow 
any character revisions.

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:51.850
I thought this matter was 
settled at the last meeting.

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:56.710
I think you'll find there aren't many people 
who love little sisters more than me.

00:11:57.340 --> 00:12:01.190
And forgive me for saying this, 
but I believe that includes Sakurada-san.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:03.580
What's this about?

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:06.490
Have your eyes suddenly opened
to the wonders of little sister moe?

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:09.260
No, I just remembered...

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:13.080
...how much I love little sisters.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.520
O-Onii-chan!

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:18.100
Which is why I can say this:

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:21.300
You're the one who doesn't 
understand little sister moe.

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:23.840
You surprise me.

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:27.300
You really want a debate
 about little sisters?

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:29.340
Not exactly.

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:34.810
I haven't heard your reasons for liking 
little sisters yet, so care to share?

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:37.860
Hmph. Very well.

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:44.440
A little sister is the closest person to the 
protagonist, but also, the furthest away.

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:48.040
The immorality born from 
such a gap is like a drug.

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:51.080
Once you've experienced it, 
you can never go back.

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:57.220
So I believe only those who can express 
their eternal desire for little sisters,

00:12:57.220 --> 00:13:05.680
even after licking and sniffing them, 
can say they love little sister moe.

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:06.690
Stop!

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:10.580
I understand now. That's enough.

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:12.140
As I thought...

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:15.560
You don't know the first thing 
about little sister moe!

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:19.020
W-What did you say?

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:21.860
You have no right to say such a thing!

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:24.170
I'm sorry, but...

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:28.820
You're only thinking about your own desires.

00:13:29.230 --> 00:13:32.830
You've overlooked the most important 
part: the little sister's feelings.

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:35.270
Th-The little sister's feelings?

00:13:35.270 --> 00:13:36.680
That's right.

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:39.450
You should only act on your 
infatuation with your little sister

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:42.840
if your little sister wants you to!

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:44.590
That's impossible.

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:49.590
Denying it's even possible only proves 
that you don't get little sister moe.

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:51.600
You only lust after little sisters.

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:53.420
Wh-What nonsense!

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:57.540
If you're not prepared to be
 hated by your little sister,

00:13:57.540 --> 00:14:00.610
then you don't really love little sister moe!

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:01.360
Hah!

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.610
You just admitted 
you lust after little sisters.

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:06.530
Wh-What?

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:14.160
O-O-O-Onii-chan?!

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:19.170
When even your real little sister likes you, 
that's proves you find little sisters moe.

00:14:20.310 --> 00:14:22.670
You really are something 
else, Towano Chikai.

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:24.780
I-I won't accept it.

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:29.640
I will never accept that someone 
who loves little sister moe

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:32.680
could ever be loved by 
their actual little sister!

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:39.920
I-In that case, I'm definitely 
gonna rework the character!

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:44.900
I'll make her exactly like my little
 sister and fawn over her hard.

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:46.400
Hold it right there!

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:52.440
I'm not going to let you alter 
any part of this divine story!

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:53.660
Me neither!

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:57.740
I won't let you change such 
a wonderful character!

00:14:57.740 --> 00:14:58.910
Wh-Who are you?

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:01.170
Wh-Why are you two...

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.320
Just who are you two?!

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:06.670
Nii-san, cut it out already!

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:12.680
E-Even Sakura's here?

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:15.680
S-S-Sakura-tan?!

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:18.980
Don't call me Sakura-tan!

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:21.240
More importantly, 
what's the meaning of this?

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:24.560
I-It's not what you think! 
There's a reason for all this...

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:30.350
I'd love to hear your reasons 
for doing something as stupid

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:33.070
as reworking the characters.

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:37.080
I-I'm sorry!

00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:39.970
U-Um, Sakura?

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:42.830
Towano-sensei, sorry about all this.

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:46.340
I'm sorry my stupid brother
caused so much trouble for you.

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:50.340
Surely not... Sakurada-san's your brother?

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:55.590
I tried to catch my brother and find out 
what was going on before he got here,

00:15:55.590 --> 00:15:58.850
but I missed him, so I just followed him here.

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.160
So?

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:04.120
Why are you trying to 
rework his main character?

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:10.820
Th-That was just a slip of the tongue... 
I didn't mean it... uh, erm, um...

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:17.410
In other words, you were 
jealous of Towano-sensei.

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:20.810
You'd just run away from home,

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:24.830
so when he waltzed in with his 
little sister, as happy as a clam,

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:26.330
it flipped a switch in me...

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:29.950
Good grief. All this trouble 
over something so ridiculous?

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:32.090
You're like a little child.

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:37.220
Do you have any idea how much trouble
 you've caused for Sensei?

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:42.060
I-I really didn't mean to say what I said, but...

00:16:42.440 --> 00:16:44.640
When I heard from your manager

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:50.530
that you were staying at Sensei's house, 
I had a rush of blood to the head.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.780
You'll accept your punishment?

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:58.000
A-Anyway,

00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:02.920
I gained a new appreciation of little sister 
moe, thanks to Towano-sensei's work,

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:07.790
so I never <i>really</i> meant to repay 
him by being spiteful, honest!

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:08.680
Huh?

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:11.300
Are you saying you went nuts 
for little sister moe because...

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:12.800
That's right.

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:18.320
Your work was so wonderful, I realized 
I needed to truly love little sister moe

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:22.560
if I was going to turn this divine 
masterpiece into an anime series!

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:28.120
Your novel really is impressive, driving 
someone stark raving bonkers like that.

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:33.690
Right? Sensei's light 
novels are just that great!

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:38.570
S-So that's why you did 
all those creepy things?

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:40.800
But if I didn't go at least that far,

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:44.870
I had no hope of matching 
Towano-sensei's love for little sisters.

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:49.220
Nii-san, you need to apologize to Sensei.

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:55.100
I'm truly sorry.

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:59.590
I-It's fine, so please stop groveling.

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:03.100
Thank you very much.

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:06.780
Sensei may have forgiven 
you, but I haven't yet.

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:11.320
This is a good opportunity for you 
to truly regret what you've done.

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:12.110
Yes, ma'am.

00:18:12.510 --> 00:18:17.410
Hm, I didn't realize Sakurada 
was so loco for little sisters...

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:21.870
Still, you're something else, Sensei.

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:24.120
Huh? Why do you say that?

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:28.680
Because you haven't let go of your 
little sister this entire time.

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:32.220
You're the king of little sister moe.

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:36.510
Onii-chan...

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:39.470
S-Sorry, Suzuka.

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:46.090
Onii-chan, how much <i>do</i>
 you love little sisters?

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:52.510
Okay, Towano-sensei, 
you can leave the rest to me.

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:54.660
Thank you.

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:01.940
Sensei, I'm truly sorry about today.

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:05.850
I'll be sure to give my brother strict 
orders to worship you like a god,

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:09.150
since you're the best older brother ever.

00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:13.260
Oh, uh, no. I'd rather you didn't go that far...

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:20.590
Man, your passion for little 
sisters today was so cool.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:22.250
Y-Yeah.

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:25.760
What you said was pretty out there, 
but you were very manly today.

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:28.930
Huh? Why are you two here?

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:34.160
It's only natural for a pupil 
to come to her master's aid.

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:36.610
We got a call from Ah-he,

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:39.000
and while <i>I</i> couldn't have cared less,

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:43.440
my older sister insisted on 
coming, so I had to tag along.

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:45.370
More importantly, how'd it go?

00:19:46.970 --> 00:19:48.120
Well, actually...

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:52.540
So that's what happened.

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:54.710
Impressive, master.

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:57.820
W-Well. Good for you, I guess?

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:04.600
Thank you for today, everyone.

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:10.680
Of course I'd be by your side. 
I'm your partner, after all!

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:15.770
I-I'm your number one fan and rival, 
so it was only natural I'd show up.

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:20.960
Sensei?

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:21.690
Yeah?

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:27.010
I told you I hadn't given up on 
becoming your favorite little sister,

00:20:27.010 --> 00:20:29.980
but I also haven't given up on being 
your other "number one," either.

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:30.700
Huh?

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:33.600
I don't know what "number 
one" she's referring to,

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:37.340
but I'm nominating myself 
as "number one" mistress!

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:39.950
I'm your "number one" pupil,

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:44.220
so you are allowed to do 
with me as you see fit.

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:47.460
Onee-chan, don't sell 
yourself short like that!

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:49.510
Wh-What is this nonsense?

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:52.730
I-I, uh, um...

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:56.560
O-Onii-chan...

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:57.380
What is it?

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:05.320
Onii-chan, um, you love little sisters, right?

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:09.530
U-Uh, I-I do, but don't get the wrong idea!

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:11.800
I'll never look at you in that way!

00:21:11.800 --> 00:21:13.570
I understand that.

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:18.250
But you love little sisters, right?

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:22.890
I d-do.

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:30.980
Onii-chan loves little sisters.

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:50.030
Onii-chan loves little sisters.

00:21:55.060 --> 00:21:58.500
<b>Maruneko Bookstore</b>

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:57.940
Here.

00:21:58.900 --> 00:22:01.310
Sorry for calling you in so early, Nagamin.

00:22:01.310 --> 00:22:03.780
We got a lot of stock in today.

00:22:03.780 --> 00:22:07.890
I just happened to have a day off 
school anyway, so it's no problem.

00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:09.840
Entrance ceremony, right?

00:22:09.840 --> 00:22:11.010
Yeah, that's right.

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:13.360
Well, anyway, thank you.

00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:18.250
I'll pay you the overtime,
 and breakfast's on me.

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:19.840
Huh?

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:22.120
Nagamin. Nagamin.

00:22:22.120 --> 00:22:23.350
What is it?

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:31.370
Good morning, Onii-chan.

00:22:32.270 --> 00:22:34.340
Yeah, good morning.

00:22:36.020 --> 00:22:38.000
Is it already time for the ceremonies?

00:22:38.230 --> 00:22:39.090
Yes.

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:43.380
Take care getting there.

00:22:43.380 --> 00:22:43.980
Okay.

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:47.010
What is it?

00:22:50.360 --> 00:22:51.510
Onii-chan...

00:22:52.840 --> 00:22:57.520
Um... how does my uniform look?

00:22:59.200 --> 00:23:02.270
Yeah. It looks really good on you.

00:23:04.720 --> 00:23:06.780
Okay, I'd better get going.

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:07.840
Yeah!

00:23:16.760 --> 00:23:20.740
I'll be counting on you in 
high school, too, Onii-chan!

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:39.930
Thanks for watching!

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:39.930
Illustrator: Gintarou

00:23:25.680 --> 00:23:27.340
Yes, hello! Esaka-san here!

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:29.310
We're ending with Hatanaka-kun!

00:23:29.310 --> 00:23:30.670
Huh? Who's this "Hatanaka-kun"?

00:23:30.670 --> 00:23:33.320
The protagonist, Hatanaka-kun, 
is the only recurring male character,

00:23:33.320 --> 00:23:34.620
and he's funky cool, yeah!

00:23:34.620 --> 00:23:35.680
Just who is Hatanaka-kun?

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:37.080
Here's hoping we get another!

00:23:37.080 --> 00:23:37.770
See you later!

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:39.600
Even in the final episode, 
you're still ignoring me?!
